This repo has data and software of the paper:

F. J. Villanueva, D. Villa, M. J. Santofimia, J. Barba and J. C. Lopez, "Crowdsensing smart city parking monitoring," Internet of Things (WF-IoT), 2015 IEEE 2nd World Forum on, Milan, 2015, pp. 751-756.
doi: 10.1109/WF-IoT.2015.7389148
keywords: {automobiles;computerised monitoring;intelligent sensors;intelligent transportation systems;magnetometers;mobile computing;smart phones;car parking monitoring;crowdsensing;magnetometer;mobile phone;smart city;smart phone sensor;Automobiles;Engines;Magnetic sensors;Magnetometers;Mobile handsets;Monitoring;Crowdsensing;Smart City;magnetometer;parking problem;smart phone sensors},
URL: http://ieeexplore.ieee.org/stamp/stamp.jsp?tp=&arnumber=7389148&isnumber=7389012

You also can find the paper in:
http://arco.esi.uclm.es/en/render-paper?paper=2015-WFIOT

You are free of use data and examples for your own research, please cite the article above in your publications.

